@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Teacher exam wizard (Admin_Web_Panel pages/teacher/CreateExamPage.tsx, routes /teacher/create-exam and
' /teacher/exams/:examId/edit) and ExamsController.CreateExam / UpdateExam / ValidateExamPayloadAsync /
' RefuseOtherTeachersStudentsAsync / MapQuestions

|Web Panel (Teacher)|
start
:Open /teacher/create-exam\n(edit: /teacher/exams/{id}/edit);
:1 Basic Info: title, section,\ndate, start time, duration;
:2 Questions: MCQ (options,\ncorrect answer), Theory,\nCoding (public or hidden\ntest cases);
:3 Rules & Settings: allowed\napps, lockdown mode,\nwebcam, mic, readiness,\nIsMock, seat, capture\nintervals;
:4 Assign Students\n(each step checked\nbefore Next);
repeat
  :POST /api/exams\n(edit: PUT\n/api/exams/{id});
  |Server|
  :(PUT first: 404, 403 if not\nown section, 409 if not\nScheduled)\nValidateExamPayloadAsync:\nown section, >= 1 question,\nmarks > 0, MCQ >= 2 options,\ncoding has a test case,\nC/C++ only (400/403/404);
  :RefuseOtherTeachersStudents-\nAsync (Teacher role; PUT:\nadded students only):\nstudents of own sections,\nelse 403 STUDENT_NOT_\nIN_YOUR_SECTIONS;
  |Web Panel (Teacher)|
backward :Show server message,\nfix the step;
repeat while (Valid?) is (no) not (yes)
|Server|
:Save Exam (Scheduled,\nAllowedApps as JSON\nlist), Questions,\nTestCases, Exam-\nAssignments; 201 Created\n(PUT: 200 OK);
|Web Panel (Teacher)|
:Return to dashboard;
stop
@enduml
